  <item>
    <title>vol.014 蒙古和满族的萨满教兴衰</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63eef02951a4e4150aa5ad9a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63eef02951a4e4150aa5ad9a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Feb 2023 03:10:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>庞大强盛的蒙古帝国，他们的萨满教有着怎样的特色？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在欧洲与亚洲的统治上，面对外来文化的冲击，萨满教是如何变化的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>满族的萨满教如何解决先天的不足，成为真正的宗教？</span></p><span></span><p><span>萨满教对于现代有何启发？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期山石新风，为你带来答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> 蒙古萨满教初窥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">09:04</a> 蒙古西征时的宗教融合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">19:52</a> 蒙古萨满教的衰落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> 满族萨满教的发展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1908">31:48</a> 清朝萨满教的改革</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> 结语</span></p><span></span><p><span>由于萨满教庞大复杂，播客自然无法言尽，后续相关补充会发在同名公众号“山石新风”中，有兴趣的朋友可以关注一下。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loGVChk2bTZsxUWp5tOFQHIFPe1S.m4a" length="63779801" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZwQm96bXR5TWV1Tms2TU9ULS12TGhUcVpQQXkucG5n.png"/>
