  <item>
    <title>vol.013 辽代之前的萨满教发展</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63a684179acee6cd2f84ddfb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63a684179acee6cd2f84ddfb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 24 Dec 2022 04:46:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>萨满教，充满神秘色彩的原始宗教。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但与此同时，它又是人类最初的宗教，见证人类文明的繁荣发展。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在中国的土地上，萨满教发生了怎样的故事？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期山石新风，为你带来答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 上期问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 萨满教的基础概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 匈奴，乌桓与突厥的萨满教</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 辽代萨满教的崛起与衰落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2434">40:34</a> 尾声</span></p><span></span><p><span>后续想起遗漏的内容会发布在同名公众号“山石新风”中，有任何题里题外的疑惑都可在评论区留言，会在评论区或下期片头解答。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr0ZVZ19mMz4KvQsLqEbRBaowGlk.m4a" length="59948953" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZwQm96bXR5TWV1Tms2TU9ULS12TGhUcVpQQXkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
