  <item>
    <title>vol.012 宋明时期的占星日常</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634e3fa39186d4e4c46a13ef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">634e3fa39186d4e4c46a13ef</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Oct 2022 05:54:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>经历了汉唐的盛世，宋朝和明朝在占星方面也有自己的成就与故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>司天监地位为何急剧下降？明代的历法为何屡屡失算？</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿拉伯人和意大利人对中国的占星有何帮助？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期山石新风，为你带来答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 宋朝时期的司天监</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="657">10:57</a> 宋朝时期的灾异观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="983">16:23</a> 明朝早期的钦天监</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a> 明代历法的衰落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">26:37</a> 西学东渐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2297">38:17</a> 结语</span></p><span></span><p><span>宋明时期乃至中间跳过的五代，后面没讲的清朝，都有各自的占星故事，不过受于篇幅限制，后续就在同名公众号“山石新风”中补充，有兴趣的朋友可以关注一下。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvT8T5N1qLQxig8M_-Vyje45dOUq.m4a" length="60825665" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:41:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZweHE3N1hzRFhZR05DZXJaY2syUjMtRkJWZ1kucG5n.png"/>
