    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Apr 2022 06:51:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>占卜是古代中国重要的活动，历朝历代的发展让占卜术也进入了百花齐放，百家争鸣的环境中。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这些占卜是如何进行的？古代社会对占卜术的看法是什么？现代人对占卜又有哪些误区？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期山石新风，为你带来答案。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 上期答疑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> 殷商时期的占卜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="812">13:32</a> 占星在古代的应用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> 望气望的是什么气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1527">25:27</a> 易经在两晋的应用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1695">28:15</a> 占梦是如何进行的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1879">31:19</a> 相术都包含什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a> 杂谈</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎关注同名公众号“山石新风”，播客没来得及说的东西会补充在里面。</span></p>]]></description>
